      "message": "test(slot): read the rows as the prefix and pin the wall lap\n\nThe slot suite collected every feed point of a level. The wall lap of #2906 adds its moves after the rows, so these tests now read the rows as the prefix, pin the lap (four quarter arcs, its direction, its tips), and count only descending arcs as the helix.\n\nRefs #2906\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
